The Sumitsubo ink pot

Covers assets/images/sumitsubo.png and the images generated from it by
scripts/generate_sumitsubo_assets.py: src/images/CatLogo.h,
src/components/icons/endOfBookCat.h and src/network/html/assets/matcha-icon.svg
(the file and symbol names are Matcha Reader's, kept so that the code that draws
them is unchanged), and the screenshots under docs/images/sumitsubo.

How it was made: a 3D model of a sumitsubo written for this project was
rendered, and the render was redrawn in a cartoon style with an image model
(ChatGPT) at the project owner's direction, then reduced to black and white by
the script.

